{"unit_id":"longhao666666__dsh-element-context#card-zh","repo":"longhao666666/dsh-element-context","commit":"70689493104b2f8d213fdae4621a5f124066bc13","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-element-context**（DSH 网页/桌面客户端插件）：把浏览器中选中的界面元素作为结构化资料加入对话上下文。它在输入框上方提供点选和手动关联入口，从侧栏浏览器采集元素的选择器、源码位置、标签、文本、页面信息、尺寸与计算样式，再由宿主端加入 systemPrompt。主要功能包括连续点选控件、按 CSS 选择器或文件行号关联，以及通过上下文 chip 移除或清空元素。适合需要向模型描述页面控件、布局或样式的 DSH 操作场景。需要 Windows 桌面版 DSH 和侧栏浏览器会话，不需要 API Key 或额外服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:65-95","host.js:137-142","client.js:741-756","client.js:763-849"]}
{"unit_id":"longhao666666__dsh-element-context#card-en","repo":"longhao666666/dsh-element-context","commit":"70689493104b2f8d213fdae4621a5f124066bc13","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-element-context adds selected page elements to DSH conversation context. Pick controls in the sidebar browser or enter a CSS selector or file:line; selector, text, source location, and styles accompany the prompt. Requires Windows desktop DSH with a sidebar browser; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:65-95","host.js:137-142","client.js:741-756","client.js:763-849"]}
