{"unit_id":"longhao666666__dsh-element-context#feature-1","repo":"longhao666666/dsh-element-context","commit":"70689493104b2f8d213fdae4621a5f124066bc13","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"点选页面控件：在侧栏浏览器中开启点选后点击目标元素，插件采集其选择器、标签、文本、源码位置、页面信息、尺寸和计算样式，并关联到当前对话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:171-199","client.js:305-315"]}
{"unit_id":"longhao666666__dsh-element-context#feature-2","repo":"longhao666666/dsh-element-context","commit":"70689493104b2f8d213fdae4621a5f124066bc13","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"手动关联元素：在输入框输入 CSS 选择器或文件:行号并提交，插件将其保存为上下文项目，适合直接指定目标而不进行页面点选。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:356-369","client.js:741-755"]}
{"unit_id":"longhao666666__dsh-element-context#feature-3","repo":"longhao666666/dsh-element-context","commit":"70689493104b2f8d213fdae4621a5f124066bc13","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"注入结构化上下文：已关联元素会在系统提示词中以单个或多个元素块呈现，包含可用的定位、文本、页面和样式信息，供后续对话引用。","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:65-95","host.js:137-142"]}
{"unit_id":"longhao666666__dsh-element-context#feature-4","repo":"longhao666666/dsh-element-context","commit":"70689493104b2f8d213fdae4621a5f124066bc13","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"管理关联项目：输入框附近显示元素 chip，可逐项移除或清空；列表最多保存 32 个不同元素，重复选择相同定位会更新已有项目。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:497-515","client.js:763-849"]}
{"unit_id":"longhao666666__dsh-element-context#caveat-1","repo":"longhao666666/dsh-element-context","commit":"70689493104b2f8d213fdae4621a5f124066bc13","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"选中的元素资料保存在本机 ~/.dsh/element-context.json，并在每次系统提示词组装时插入；每个元素可包含页面文本、地址和样式信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["host.js:13-20","host.js:137-142"]}
